dth="4688"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="11" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2132" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="5821"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="11" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2132" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7518"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="11" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2132" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="4689"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="12" ColAddr="6" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2132" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="17869"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="44" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="7" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="40584" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="47981"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="56"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="56"><CHAR>위 선박에 대하여 「</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="55"><CHAR>2007년 난파물 제거에 관한 나이로비 국제협약</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="57"><CHAR>」</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="58"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>제12조의 요건을 충족하는 보험증서 또는 그 밖의 보장계약증서가 유효함을</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="58"><CHAR> 증명함</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="22" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="51"><CHAR>This is to certify that there is in force, in respect of the above-named ship, a policy of insurance or other financial security satisfying the requirements of article 12 of the Nairobi International Convention on the Removal of Wrecks, 2007. </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>보증종류(Type of Security)</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                   </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>보증기간(Duration of Security)</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>보험자 또는 보증인의 성명 및 주소</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>Name and Address of the Insurer(s) and/or Guarantor(s)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="60"><CHAR>성</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>명(Name) </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                                </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="60"><CHAR>주</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>소(Address)</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                               </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>이 증서는 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>    년    월   일까지</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR> 유효함</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>This Certificate is valid until</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                  </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>발급 또는 인증한 정부 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR> 대 한 민 국 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>Issued or Certified by the Government of the Republic of Korea</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>발급장소 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>        지방해양항만청</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>Issued at</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>         </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>Regional Maritime Affairs and Port Office</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>발급일(Date of Issue)</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                         </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>인가자 서명(signature)</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="49"><CHAR>                                                                        </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="4" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>  </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="4" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="61"><CHAR>(           ) 지방해양항만청장  </CHAR><RECTANGLE Ratio="0" X0="0" X1="1500" X2="1500" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="1350" Y3="1350"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1785249732" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="1216" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="1491" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><DRAWINGOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="1565" CurWidth="1490" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="711507909" OriHeight="1350" OriWidth="1500" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="745" CenterY="783"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.99400" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.15992" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><LINESHAPE Alpha="0" EndCap="Flat" Style="Solid" Width="33"/><SHADOW Alpha="0" Color="0" OffsetX="0" OffsetY="0" Type="0"/><DRAWTEXT LastWidth="1491"><TEXTMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="40" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="52"><CHAR>인</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></DRAWTEXT></DRAWINGOBJECT></RECTANGLE></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="62"><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="4" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="63"><CHAR>Administrator of (         ) Regional Maritime Affairs and Port Office</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="45" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="7" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1766" Protect="false" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="47981"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="47"><CHAR>                                          297mm×210mm[인쇄용지(특급) 120g/㎡]</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="47"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="33"><TABLE BorderFill="2" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="1" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="false" RowCount="2"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1785249734" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="5"><SIZE Height="50178" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="48133" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="13" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1766" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="48133"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR>(</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="64"><CHAR>뒷</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR>면)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="43" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="48412" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="48133"><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="65"><CHAR>작성요령:</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="65"/></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR> 1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="66"><CHAR>필요한 경우 국명을 적을 때에는 증명서가 발급된 국가의 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR>관계 공공기관에 대하여 언급할 수 있다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="38" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR> 2. 보증의 총액이 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR>둘 이상</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR>의 재원(財源)에 의하여 제공되는 경우, 각각의 해당 금액을 표시해야 한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR> 3. 보증이 여러 형태로 설정된 경우에는 이들을 열거해야 한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR> 4. 보증기간의 난에는 보증이 발효하는 날짜와 기간을 명기(明記)해야 한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"><CHAR> 5. 보험자의 주소란은 보험자의 주요 사업소재지를 기록하여야 한다. 보험사가 설립된 곳을 확인할 수 있는 경우에는 함께 명기하여야 한다. </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="45"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="65"><CHAR> Explanatory Notes:</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="67"/></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="67"><CHAR> 1. If desired, the designation of the State may include a reference to the competent public authority of the country where the certificate is issued.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="67"><CHAR> 2. If the total amount of security has been furnished by more than one source, the amount of each of them should be indicated.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="67"><CHAR> 3. If security is furnished in several forms, these should be enumerated.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="67"><CHAR> 4. The entry "Duration of security" must stipulate the date on which such security takes effect.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="67"><CHAR> 5. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="67"><CHAR>The entry “Address” of the insurer(s) and/or guarantor(s) must indicate the principal place of business of the insurer(s) and/or guarantor(s). If appropriate, the place of business where the insurance or other security is established shall be indicated. </CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="33"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="33"/></P></SECTION><SECTION Id="1"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="32" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="33"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><SECDEF CharGrid="0" FirstBorder="false" FirstFill="false" LineGrid="0" SpaceColumns="1134" TabStop="8000" TextDirection="0" TextVerticalWidthHead="0"><STARTNUMBER Equation="0" Figure="0" Page="0" PageStartsOn="Both" Ta